      "writtenOn": "2020-01-06T17:58:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it should be EMMA_INSTRUMENT_FRAMEWORK, because this is what adds dependencies of the Core libraries on jacoco. With only EMMA_INSTRUMENT jacoco doesn\u0027t need to be included in the ART boot image (I actually tested this; see commit message).\n\nMy initial attempt to generalize to a helper function IsCoverageBuild() was misleading, I got rid of it (especially since other places in Soong test for EMMA_* environment variables directly).",
