        "id": 1550939
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-01-06T17:58:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This dependency controls if jacocoagent.jar is added to the ART apex, and installed on device, which seems to be needed both with or without EMMA_INSTRUMENT_STATIC\u003dtrue.\n\nIf I omit this dependency in EMMA_INSTRUMENT_STATIC\u003dtrue builds, the phone fails to boot in the same way as in EMMA_INSTRUMENT_STATIC\u003dfalse builds: it fails to find DEX bytecode for jacoco methods when initializing bootclasspath classes (with or without EMMA_INSTRUMENT_STATIC\u003dtrue).\n\nI did test that EMMA_INSTRUMENT_STATIC\u003dtrue build boots with this CL (see commit message).",
      "parentUuid": "a9583c28_bec81937",
      "revId": "b8095f555e034a500ddc384670e4d6d158f8a751",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "28283a18_6fcf89b7",
        "filename": "apex/apex.go",
