      "writtenOn": "2020-01-06T18:22:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "EMMA_INSTRUMENT_STATIC\u003dtrue failing without this seems odd, with that flag jacocoagent should have been added as a static library to every jar that has instrumentation enabled, so it should be in the bootclasspath.  See https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/java/java.go;l\u003d654?q\u003dshouldinstrumentstatic",
      "parentUuid": "5592e7b3_3534e3cf",
      "revId": "b8095f555e034a500ddc384670e4d6d158f8a751",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1da9fe8a_5702b8b7",
